		(property "Note" "Overvoltage guard on the always-on 3.3 V: +12V, +5V or |-12V| above its threshold pulls OV_N low (U12 2PRE_N) -> FAULT -> RUN low -> U5 off. Last resort for a shorted high-side FET or an open feedback resistor; the TPS62933F own OVP (112-118 %) acts first on +12/+5. Comparator 4 spare (+ to GND, - to REF_GOOD)"
